  "body": "Beachside Living, Prime Takapuna Location — Secure Your Coastal Lifestyle Today\r\n\r\nEmbrace the best of Takapuna living in this beautifully presented residence at the sought-after Maison Apartments, where effortless coastal lifestyle meets everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nBathed in natural light, the thoughtfully designed open-plan living and dining area flows seamlessly onto a sunny private deck — the perfect spot for your morning coffee, alfresco entertaining, or simply unwinding after a day by the beach.\r\n\r\nThe home offers two generously proportioned and well-separated bedrooms and two bathrooms, creating a comfortable sense of space and privacy. Whether you’re a busy professional, downsizer, or savvy investor, this versatile property is designed to suit a variety of lifestyles.\r\n\r\nEveryday living is made easy with two secure car parks and additional storage, while the solid concrete construction and low-maintenance nature of the property provide peace of mind for those seeking a lock-up-and-leave lifestyle.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n• Approx 77sqm\r\n• Two well-separated bedrooms\r\n• Two bathrooms\r\n• Light-filled open-plan living and dining\r\n• Sunny private deck with excellent indoor-outdoor flow\r\n• Two secure car parks\r\n• Additional storage\r\n• Solid concrete construction\r\n• Low-maintenance and lock-up-and-leave living\r\n• Ideal for professionals, downsizers and investors\r\n• Easy walk to Takapuna Beach\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned just moments from Takapuna Beach, vibrant cafés, restaurants, boutique shopping and convenient transport, with easy access to Auckland CBD, this is coastal living at its most convenient.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re looking for your own seaside retreat, a stylish downsizer, or a quality investment in one of the North Shore’s most desirable locations, this is an opportunity not to be missed.",
